OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to demolish vandal-hit
OL,4,Aoffice block
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former European headquarters of TK
OL,7,FMaxx's parent company is being knocked
OL,8,Fdown, having stood empty for about
OL,9,Fseven years.
OL,11,FThe dilapidated building on Clarendon
OL,12,FRoad, near Watford Junction railway
OL,13,Fstation, had become a target for
OL,14,Fvandals, with windows smashed and
OL,15,Fgraffiti sprayed across its walls.
OL,17,FIn June, police and firefighters were
OL,18,Fcalled to the site after concerns about
OL,19,Fthe safety of three children who had
OL,20,Fbeen seen on the roof.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
