OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to demolish vandal-hit
OL,4,Aoffice block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Hertfordshire Police
OL,7,Fsaid: "There have been repeated
OL,8,Fincidents of vandalism and unauthorised
OL,9,Faccess at the building, with
OL,10,Findividuals engaging in urban exploring
OL,11,Factivities that place them at
OL,12,Fsignificant risk of harm."
